{"parse": {"title": "DAU-00", "pageid": 94343, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%B4%E6%8B%89%C2%B7%E9%BB%8E%E6%98%8E%E4%BE%9D%E6%97%A7%E5%88%B0%E6%9D%A5\" title=\"维拉·黎明依旧到来\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DAU-00</span><a href=\"/wiki/DAU-01\" title=\"DAU-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DAU</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">00</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A5.E8.90.BD.E6.97.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"日落时\">日落时</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 日落时</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">At Dusk</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台主播Ⅰ：</div><div>今日，卡斯林斯卡医学院附属医院接收了一例罕见病例。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台主播Ⅰ：</div><div>某患者血管呈现出了不可逆的电线化特征。截止至18：00时，该患者全身的动脉、静脉及毛细血管组织均已坏死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台主播Ⅰ：</div><div>卡斯林斯卡医学院院长受访时称，他们将邀请更多专业人员参与会诊，商讨后续的研究工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台主播Ⅰ：</div><div>《世界新奇报》声称，“电线人”症状将会成为新的未解之谜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电台主播Ⅰ：</div><div>同时，他们发起了专栏活动，旨在分析该“电线人”的血管构造对不同电器的应用频率……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>电流将每一道播报人声包裹着反复传递，直到它们在寂静中变得喑哑而惴惴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>房间里，受到邀请的客人谨慎地将失真的讯息收入头脑之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-308720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-308720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-308720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>她伸手，摸索着找到按钮，终于叫停了吵嚷的源头。这些信息对清除等待的烦忧并无益处。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>一个小时五十分钟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>这太慢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>多数时候，善于等待是一种被夸赞的普世美德，在这片土地上尤其如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>人们似乎一直在等。等待改变，等待援手，等待救赎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>但显然，这种“美德”不是今天的客人所需要的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>命名日先生或许被什么更紧要的事绊住了脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我真应该主动要求同他去看看的。亲眼见到孩子们，好过在这里白白等着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>就算，这里并不是属于我的地方，不该要求太多……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>可我总得做些什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>思索中，她环视四周，留意到角柜上的庞然大物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>基金会的客卧舒适而宽大，比维拉上岸之后所见的一切房屋都要敞亮和高雅许多，即使它只是分部的一个临时房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>这种舒适当然包含了生活设施上的齐全。例如，瞧，一台电视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>呼，好吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>让我来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>应该和食堂里的那台电视一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使对这些东西算不上熟悉，搭配说明书也不难使用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很快，画面就如愿出现在了闪烁雪花的屏幕上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>是芭蕾舞剧节目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……《天鹅湖》。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>哈哈。看来人人都爱它，在远东也不例外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>很可惜，现在不是欣赏它的恰当时候。我需要一些别的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不是天鹅湖。天鹅湖、天鹅湖……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……咦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>什么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>为什么都是天鹅湖？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有频道都播放着同样的节目。每一次换台，舞剧都不断靠近着尾声，荧幕上的王子单膝跪下，伸手挽留逐渐远去的奥杰塔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门外，急促的脚步声也与电视中不谐的音乐鼓点踩合。而后，敲门声响起。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>维拉女士！您还在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我在！请进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-623720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>维拉女士，抱歉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>怎么了？命名日先生，你慢些说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>是不是孩子们，出了什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>——是“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“暴雨”？暴雨怎么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>而且，阿夫西维失踪了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>——？！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DAU-00"}}